OL,3,GNEWSANew signs as part of welcome at
OL,4,Aairport
OL,5,
OL,6,FJersey Airport has had a makeover with
OL,7,Fnew signs to welcome passengers as they
OL,8,Farrive on the island.
OL,10,FThe signs at aircraft stands and in the
OL,11,Fairport were designed to celebrate
OL,12,FJersey's unique identity, managing
OL,13,Fdirector Dale Reeson said.
OL,15,FThey include a greeting in Jerriais, to
OL,16,Fgive people flying in from the UK and
OL,17,FEuropean destinations "a distinctly
OL,18,Flocal welcome from the moment they
OL,19,Farrive".
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
