OL,3,GNEWSANew signs as part of welcome at
OL,4,Aairport
OL,5,
OL,6,FLast year 1.4 million journeys were
OL,7,Fmade by passengers to and from Jersey.
OL,8,FReeson said: "The moment you arrive
OL,9,Fsomewhere shapes your first impression
OL,10,Fand we want people landing in Jersey to
OL,11,Ffeel an immediate sense of place and a
OL,12,Fgenuine welcome, whether passengers
OL,13,Farriving home or visiting our island."
